  "content": "\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/j7lnXpb.png\" alt=\"banner1\" />\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/structural-beyond\">\n    <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/intergrav/devins-badges/refs/heads/v3/assets/cozy/available/modrinth_64h.png\" alt=\"Modrinth\" />\n  </a>\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/structural-beyond\">\n    <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/intergrav/devins-badges/refs/heads/v3/assets/cozy/available/curseforge_64h.png\" alt=\"CurseForge\" />\n  </a>\n  <a href=\"https://gamejolt.com/games/structural_beyond_mc/944658\">\n    <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/h85Hg1b.png\" alt=\"GameJolt\" />\n  </a>\n  <a href=\"https://d4vide106.itch.io/structuralbeyond-mc\">\n    <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Qz2uWJJ.png\" alt=\"Itch.io\" />\n  </a>\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n   <strong>🌟 Structural Beyond 🌟</strong><br/>\n   一款沉浸式模組，旨在透過全新的原版風格建築為 Minecraft 世界增添色彩。完美融入原版玩法，本模組精心挑選了一系列獨特的建築結構，會自然生成於不同的生物群系中。\n</p>\n\n## ✨ 特色\n\n<p align=\"left\">\n  🌍 <strong>探索 12 種以上獨特建築</strong>\n</p>\n  \n  - 🏕️ **營地** - 一個小型露營地，藏有戰利品與驚喜。\n  - 🗼 **方塔** - 一座守護寶藏的神祕高塔。\n  - 🔮 **巫師之屋** - 強大法師的居所。\n  - 🌊 **海底劍** - 沉沒於深海之下的傳奇武器。\n  - 🪨 **深板岩之柱** - 深埋地底的巍峨巨柱。\n  - 🍄 **蘑菇屋** - 隱藏在蘑菇生物群系中的溫馨小屋。\n  - 🌱 **大地傀儡** - 守護大地的自然守護者。\n\n<p align=\"right\">\n  🏰 <strong>符合原作設定的自然融合</strong><br/>\n  每座建築皆採用原版風格設計，能自然融入 Minecraft 的生物群系與世界構築之中。\n</p>\n\n---\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  🚧 <strong>目前為 Beta 測試版</strong> 🚧<br/>\n  敬請期待後續更新，將加入更多建築與各項改進！\n</p>\n\n\n\n<p align=\"left\">\n  <strong>📢 有任何回饋或發現問題嗎？</strong><br/>\n  <a href=\"https://discord.gg/thfPJ7QAPJ\">\n    <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/intergrav/devins-badges/refs/heads/v3/assets/compact/social/discord-plural_46h.png\" alt=\"Discord\" />\n  </a>\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"right\">\n  <strong>💖 透過捐贈來支持！</strong><br/>\n  <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/checkout/InfinityWonderful?rid=0&cadence=1&custom=1\">\n    <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/intergrav/devins-badges/refs/heads/v3/assets/compact/donate/patreon-singular_46h.png\" alt=\"Patreon\">\n  </a><br/>\n  <em>您的支持有助於我改進和更新此模組。謝謝！</em>\n</p>\n\n<details>\n  <summary>🔧 支援的模組載入器</summary>\n  <p align=\"center\">\n    <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/intergrav/devins-badges/refs/heads/v3/assets/compact-minimal/supported/fabric_46h.png\" alt=\"Fabric\" />\n    <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/intergrav/devins-badges/refs/heads/v3/assets/compact-minimal/supported/forge_46h.png\" alt=\"Forge\" />\n    <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/intergrav/devins-badges/refs/heads/v3/assets/compact-minimal/unsupported/quilt_46h.png\" alt=\"Quilt\" />\n    <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/data-packs/structural-beyond-sb-datapack\">\n      <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/1G0f1rR.png\" alt=\"Datapack\" />\n    </a>\n  </p>\n</details>\n\n<details>\n  <summary>🌟 整合包中使用規範</summary>\n  <p align=\"left\">\n    您可以自由將 **Structural Beyond** 收錄於您的整合包中，但請務必附上原始來源連結。您也可以分享此模組，但請確保適當標註作者 D4vide106 的創作，並提供本頁面的連結，或指向 Modrinth、CurseForge 或其他官方授權平台的正式來源。\n\n  </p>\n</details>\n\n<p align=\"left\">\n  <strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/9AdFsCE.png\" alt=\"Creator\" /> 由 D4vide106 製作</strong><br/>\n  <em>這是我的首個模組——感謝您的支持！</em>\n</p>",
